                       "description":  "The \u0027Remote agent\u0027 task type lets users schedule arbitrary Claude prompts without pre-registering them in the prompt library. When this radio is selected the form reveals a multi-line prompt textarea, optional working directory, model selector, allowed-tools chip group, and an Advanced disclosure containing max-turns, timeout, and MCP-connection editor. At dispatch time the runner\u0027s launch_remote_agent calls POST /prompts/run with these fields. The form\u0027s defaults match the runner-side defaults (model = sonnet-4-6, allowed_tools = Bash/Read/Write/Edit/Glob/Grep, max_turns = 50, timeout = 600s); drift between form defaults and runner defaults causes silent behavior changes.",
